      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hotspot Bot — Admin Monitoring\n\nRuns every 6 hours on a schedule.\nCalls the MikroTik REST API to fetch the current voucher pool, counts active vouchers, and checks if the count is below 10.\nIf low: sends a Discord alert to admin and logs LOW status to Health Log.\nIf OK: logs OK status to Health Log. Every run is recorded for trend tracking.",
